  "description": "Born with overwhelming physical strength, Ma Geumgang feared nothing in the world. But while pushing his power to its absolute limit, he was cast into Hell. To make matters worse, even his parents have ended up there. The only way back to his original world is to defeat the sinners of Hell and rise to become its strongest warrior. A brutal, high-octane martial arts action story of a man who smashes his way through Hell itself.\n\n**Original Webtoon:** [Naver](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=850745), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14168919)",
